WEBINAR: Proactive Prospecting in a Negative Economy

* Are you disappointed with the results you're getting from your existing
prospecting efforts?
* Have you invested substantial time and money into lead lists only to be
met by a wall of objections and rejection?
* Are you ready to make the most of your existing resources to generate a
consistent flow of new appointments?
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Get a head start by attending this valuable event.=20
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Date: October 30, 2013
Time: 1:00PM EST
Presented by: The CEO Sales Solution
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Benefits of Attending this Webinar:

* Discover key techniques to break through the gatekeeper and get straigh=
t
to the decision-maker.
* Understand why commonly used bonding and rapport techniques destroy any
chance you have in effectively engaging with the prospect.
* Identify the major mistakes most sales people make during the first
thirty seconds of the engagement with the prospect that results in
immediate rejection and lost opportunity.
* Discover key techniques that will get your prospect actively engaging
with you instead of simply tolerating your pitch and ending the call with=
 a
vague promise of interest in the distant future.
* Discover critical communication strategies to use during the prospectin=
g
phase that will aid you in controlling the rest of the sales process.
* Uncover the primary triggers of call reluctance that results in
diminished production and lost opportunities for you or your sales team.
* Participate in the paradigm shift necessary to overcome the destructive
cycle of call reluctance.
* Discover how to effectively utilize key techniques during the last thir=
ty
seconds of your call to get your prospect emotionally vested in meeting
with you.
* Discover effective strategies to use with warm leads that will set you
apart from the competition in the mind of the prospect.
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
